        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: R. M. Hare, David Abram\n- Organizations: Journal in Denton, Texas\n- Places: Denton, Texas\n- Products: The Spell of the Sensuous: Perception and Language in a More-than-Human World\n- Topics: Ecopsychology, ecological disarray\n\nFacts:\n- David Abram wrote the ecopsychology book \"The Spell of the Sensuous: Perception and Language in a More-than-Human World.\"\n- A journal located in Denton, Texas often features David Abram's ecological disarray.\n- R. M. Hare is editor-in-chief of that journal.",
